  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">About our brand and products:</span></strong></p><p data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"533\" id=\"isPasted\">Xcape by Edith Delight is a science-backed skincare brand formulated specifically for melanin-rich skin. After <strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"385\">7 years of clinical research in tropical climates</strong>, our formulas have been refined and enhanced with nanotechnology to deliver deeper, more effective results.&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"762\">We offer a range of products for face and body: cleansers, creams, toners, serums, body milks, treatment glycerines, etc. We also provide custom formulations based on customer skin needs.&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"966\">Our mission goes beyond skincare: we believe in empowering our customers’ confidence and providing skincare solutions that truly work for under-served skin types.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">What makes us different:</span></strong></p><ul><li data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1279\" id=\"isPasted\"><p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1279\"><strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1044\">Specialization for melanin-rich skin</strong>: many skincare brands don’t design for tropical, melanin skin; we have done the research so ours address issues like hyperpigmentation, dark spots, tone unevenness, dryness + oil imbalance, etc.</p></li><li data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1421\"><p data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1421\"><strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1313\">Nanotechnology formulations</strong>: our use of nano-technology improves penetration and effectiveness.</p></li><li data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1600\"><p data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1600\"><strong data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1449\">Customizable products</strong>: customers can fill a questionnaire so that ingredients and actives are tailored to their specific skin needs.</p></li><li data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1860\"><p data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1860\"><strong data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1629\">Affiliate-driven model</strong>: instead of relying mainly on ad agencies, Xcape invests in individuals, creating partnerships with people who believe in the brand. This both spreads awareness organically and shares value.</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">How affiliates can earn:</span></strong></p><ul><li data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"2025\" id=\"isPasted\"><p data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"2025\">Affiliates earn <strong data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1941\">25% lifetime commission</strong> on every sale made through their link/code.</p></li><li data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2141\"><p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2141\">Affiliates get a <strong data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2065\">5% discount code</strong> to share with first-time customers.&nbsp;</p></li><li data-start=\"2142\" data-end=\"2298\"><p data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2298\">Since our model is affiliate-centric, affiliates have opportunity to build recurring earnings as customers return.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">How to promote us:</span></strong></p><ul><li data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2475\" id=\"isPasted\"><p data-start=\"2330\" data-end=\"2475\">Share before &amp; after photos/testimonials: real results are compelling, especially for problems like hyperpigmentation, dark spots, uneven tone.</p></li><li data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2641\"><p data-start=\"2478\" data-end=\"2641\">Leverage social media (Instagram, Facebook, possibly TikTok): posts, reels, stories showing skin improvements, usage of our custom products, daily skin routines.</p></li><li data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2729\"><p data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2729\">Use the 5% off code as a hook (“try now, get 5% off”) to encourage first purchases.</p></li><li data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2844\"><p data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2844\">Collaborate with beauty/fashion influencers whose audience includes melanin skin, twin with skin-care content.</p></li><li data-start=\"2845\" data-end=\"2959\"><p data-start=\"2847\" data-end=\"2959\">Maybe create blog posts or guides about caring for melanin-rich tropical skin, using our products as examples.</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Other information:</span></strong></p><ul data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3543\" id=\"isPasted\"><li data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3123\"><p data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3123\">Shipping: fast shipping to USA &amp; UK in <strong data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3051\">2-3 business days</strong>, Europe in ~15 business days.&nbsp;</p></li><li data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3273\"><p data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3273\">Brand vision: confidence, empowerment, underserved skin types. Inspired by medical aesthetics background.&nbsp;</p></li><li data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3409\"><p data-start=\"3276\" data-end=\"3409\">Products include both ready-line skincare and custom formulations for deeper skin concerns.&nbsp;</p></li><li data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3543\"><p data-start=\"3412\" data-end=\"3543\">Our product categories include Face, Body, Skin Concerns, Custom Products, Full Sets etc.&nbsp;</p></li></ul></div></div>",
